Package: sesquipower
Title: Reactive Power Optimization with Hermitian Forms
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Johanna", "Ngobo", , "songa_johanna@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes the complex, active, reactive and apparent power of a
    single-phase domestic installation from the RMS values and phases of
    voltage and current, using the Hermitian form h(U, I) = U * Conj(I).
    Converts powers into energies and tariff-based costs, and sizes the
    capacitors needed to bring the reactive power down to a target value.
